    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1705">

                <pb facs="1389" n="1273" xml:id="pg1273"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 834.00/119.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-12-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 21, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Isasi resigns from Foreign Office, succeeded by Irala. Four Brazilian war vessels
                    left Montevideo yesterday for Asuncion. Argentina also strengthens her fleet.
                    Brazil for, Argentina against the Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grevstad.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
